{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":96039,\"title\":\"Crocodile and the Plover Bird\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A story about young people hoping to pioneer architectural improvements that will benefit the generations to come. A stone-faced genius meets his opposite and they clash from the start. Hate turns to love between these two people who first meet at the animal research society.\\n\\nLi Na Nen is a young woman from a small town who has always been passionate about Chinese culture and traditional architecture. After graduating, she heads to Bordeaux University to pursue her studies in the field. She somehow ends up joining the animal research society where she meets Zhou Er Wen. He is a young man who advocates ecological preservation. Given his interest in modern architecture, he is devoted to finding synergies in both. Li Na Nen and Zhou Er Wen start out at odds with each other and Gao Mu finds himself to be the constant mediator. Their experiences bring them together as they strive to bring to fruition a project referred to as the hanging garden.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jhmG9c4AlXFNDJUmtKwF0I0uWvc.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j2NWvAts8AIJXF8tJKLTEMLBijS.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2019,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":50,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Hunan Television\",\"iQiyi\",\"Mango TV\",\"Tencent Video\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CN\",\"name\":\"China\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2019-12-06\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1936002,\"name\":\"Lin Yan\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kyDSeR13X8hbxx9B4OJYTCAQ9so.jpg\"},{\"id\":64440,\"name\":\"Chen Bolin\",\"character\":\"Zhou Erwen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w89BYi3LaMFROA9gTw2vWPVcbda.jpg\"},{\"id\":1599854,\"name\":\"Zhang Tian'ai\",\"character\":\"Li Na